  "story": {
    "title": "My Home Needs Cleaning",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "My home gets dirty sometimes and when it does my family and I must clean up.",
      "We have to sweep, mop and scrub to make the house look good again.",
      "We have a cleaning chart which shows who does what and when.",
      "I sweep the house every morning.",
      "My mother prepares breakfast.",
      "My sister scrubs the floor.",
      "Father does the gardening.",
      "My brother cleans the bathroom.",
      "During the cleanup, we use a broom.",
      "We use a brush.",
      "We use a mop.",
      "My brother washes the clothes.",
      "I like a clean home but I don't like some chores. I like cleaning the bathroom but i don't like sweeping the house.",
      "﻿We are usually done cleaning up by lunch time.",
      "After lunch, I play football with my friends.",
      "After playing, I must shower before supper.",
      "When my home is clean, it makes me smile and we are happy.",
      "After a long day of cleaning, we deserve a good meal in a clean house.",
      "A clean home is the place to be! Thank you all for cleaning up today."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "My home gets dirty sometimes and when it does my family and I must clean up.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhà tôi đôi khi bị bẩn, và khi đó, cả nhà tôi phải dọn dẹp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "We have to sweep, mop and scrub to make the house look good again.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi phải quét nhà, lau nhà và cọ rửa để nhà cửa lại sạch đẹp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "We have a cleaning chart which shows who does what and when.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi có một bảng phân công việc dọn dẹp, nó cho biết ai làm gì và khi nào."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I sweep the house every morning.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tôi quét nhà mỗi sáng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My mother prepares breakfast.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ tôi chuẩn bị bữa sáng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My sister scrubs the floor.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chị/Em gái tôi cọ rửa sàn nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Father does the gardening.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bố làm vườn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My brother cleans the bathroom.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Anh/Em trai tôi dọn dẹp phòng tắm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "During the cleanup, we use a broom.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trong lúc dọn dẹp, chúng tôi dùng một cái chổi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "We use a brush.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi dùng một cái bàn chải."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "We use a mop.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi dùng một cây lau nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My brother washes the clothes.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Anh/Em trai tôi giặt quần áo."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I like a clean home but I don't like some chores.",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tôi thích một ngôi nhà sạch sẽ nhưng tôi không thích một vài việc nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I like cleaning the bathroom but i don't like sweeping the house.",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tôi thích dọn phòng tắm nhưng tôi không thích quét nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "﻿We are usually done cleaning up by lunch time.",
        "paragraph_index": 13,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi thường dọn dẹp xong trước giờ ăn trưa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "After lunch, I play football with my friends.",
        "paragraph_index": 14,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau bữa trưa, tôi chơi bóng đá với bạn bè."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "After playing, I must shower before supper.",
        "paragraph_index": 15,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau khi chơi, tôi phải tắm trước bữa tối."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When my home is clean, it makes me smile and we are happy.",
        "paragraph_index": 16,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi nhà tôi sạch sẽ, nó làm tôi mỉm cười và chúng tôi đều vui vẻ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "After a long day of cleaning, we deserve a good meal in a clean house.",
        "paragraph_index": 17,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau một ngày dài dọn dẹp, chúng tôi xứng đáng có một bữa ăn ngon trong một ngôi nhà sạch sẽ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "A clean home is the place to be!",
        "paragraph_index": 18,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngôi nhà sạch sẽ là nơi tuyệt vời nhất!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Thank you all for cleaning up today.",
        "paragraph_index": 18,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_127512/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cảm ơn mọi người đã dọn dẹp hôm nay."
      }
    ]
  },
